            <img src="{{ 'size-chart-how-to-measure.png' | asset_url }}" alt="How to measure" width="971" height="1619" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="mv-size-chart-accordions">
            <div class="mv-accordion-item" data-sc-step="1"><button type="button" class="mv-accordion-header"><span class="mv-accordion-number">1</span><strong>Bust</strong><svg class="mv-chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="4,6 8,10 12,6"/></svg></button><div class="mv-accordion-content"><div class="mv-accordion-text">Measure around the fullest part of your bust, keeping the tape level around your back.</div></div></div>
            <div class="mv-accordion-item" data-sc-step="2"><button type="button" class="mv-accordion-header"><span class="mv-accordion-number">2</span><strong>Waist</strong><svg class="mv-chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="4,6 8,10 12,6"/></svg></button><div class="mv-accordion-content"><div class="mv-accordion-text">Measure around the narrowest part of your natural waistline without pulling the tape tight.</div></div></div>
            <div class="mv-accordion-item" data-sc-step="3"><button type="button" class="mv-accordion-header"><span class="mv-accordion-number">3</span><strong>Hips</strong><svg class="mv-chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="4,6 8,10 12,6"/></svg></button><div class="mv-accordion-content"><div class="mv-accordion-text">Measure around the fullest part of your hips, keeping the tape parallel to the floor.</div></div></div>
            <div class="mv-accordion-item" data-sc-step="4"><button type="button" class="mv-accordion-header"><span class="mv-accordion-number">4</span><strong>Hollow to Floor</strong><svg class="mv-chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="4,6 8,10 12,6"/></svg></button><div class="mv-accordion-content"><div class="mv-accordion-text">Measure from the hollow where the collarbones meet at the front of the neck vertically down to the floor, barefoot.</div></div></div>
            <div class="mv-accordion-item" data-sc-step="5"><button type="button" class="mv-accordion-header"><span class="mv-accordion-number">5</span><strong>Height</strong><svg class="mv-chevron" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="4,6 8,10 12,6"/></svg></button><div class="mv-accordion-content"><div class="mv-accordion-text">Stand straight and measure from the top of your head to the floor, barefoot.</div></div></div>
